    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ab363533ddcbb53c96376a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Aug 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrZD4EZ5prQba6T0PArliUfs2G3u.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>卓哥，企业培训师，知识博主，全网粉丝100W+，线下演讲2000+，是多位知名心理学大咖幕后操盘手。</span></p><span></span><p><span>卓哥的播客：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669798df37236c546ecc7f51" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/669798df37236c546ecc7f51"><span>卓哥慧客厅</span></a><span>，是一档分享超级个体和创业者，如何在事业和家庭生活中找到共鸣和支持的播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span>卓哥将与我们分享他从技术达人转型到自媒体大神的心路历程，以及他对个人品牌建设以及生活态度的见解。一起探索如何在不断变化的互联网浪潮中保持自我，创造价值。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> - 抓住机会成为微软认证讲师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> - 晋升父亲打开新世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> - 培训机构掌舵人新视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a>- 无奈之下尝试自媒体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1773">29:33</a> - 不断试错不怕撞南墙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a> - 直播也是体力活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2372">39:32</a> - 知识付费模式深度思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> - IP不只是标签</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2809">46:49</a> - 拥抱播客新世界</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期OST】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《COME》by Namie Amuro</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>卿舟</span></p>]]></description>
